{"id":"35f9cd9f-42bc-56f3-a792-3961178925bb","title":"安装与运行","icon":"💻","cover":"none","parentId":"22aa57a1-9d74-5c5a-9c04-4fc999c8b9b4","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"安装与运行","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"macOS App · 浏览器版 · 源码","title":"安装 ShowAI","lead":"在 Apple Silicon Mac 上下载 ShowAI App 即可开始，Agent 插件和运行时都随 App 提供。使用 Windows、Linux，或参与开发时，从源码运行浏览器版。","facts":[{"label":"App","value":"Apple Silicon · macOS 13+"},{"label":"源码运行","value":"Node.js 22.12+"},{"label":"默认内容库","value":"~/.showai"},{"label":"账号","value":"本机使用无需登录"}],"actions":[{"label":"下载 ShowAI","href":"https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest","primary":true},{"label":"快速上手","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"}],"art":"workbench"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-5312bd61"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-5212bbce"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 Mac 上安装 App"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需要一台 Apple Silicon Mac，系统为 macOS 13 或更高版本。App 自带运行时，不需要安装 Node.js 或下载源码。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5112ba3b"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"下载 DMG","body":"从 GitHub 的[最新发行版](https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest)下载 DMG。发行版也提供同一个 App 的 ZIP 和校验文件 `SHA256SUMS.txt`。"},{"title":"拖进「应用程序」，然后打开","body":"打开 DMG，把 **ShowAI** 拖进「应用程序」，再从「应用程序」打开 ShowAI。","result":"首次启动时，ShowAI 显示欢迎页，其中有连接 Agent 的插件面板。"},{"title":"连接你的 Agent","body":"在欢迎页或「设置 → 插件」中，为 Claude Code 或 Codex 点「安装插件」，然后重启 Agent，新开一个对话。完整步骤见 [快速上手](doc:quick-start)。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-5012b8a8"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🛡️","tone":"sand","id":"node-5712c3ad"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"macOS 阻止首次打开？","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 当前版本尚未经过 Apple 公证，macOS 可能阻止首次打开。遇到时打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性」，选择「仍要打开」（参见 "},{"type":"text","text":"Apple 的说明","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/102445"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"）。每个版本的发行说明会写明是否仍需这一步。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6ae20b22"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"App 目前只支持 Apple Silicon Mac，暂不支持 Intel Mac。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5612c21a"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-5512c087"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"其他方式：浏览器版与源码"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Windows、Linux，或需要修改 ShowAI 本身时，运行本地浏览器版。三种方式用的是同一个工作台和同一种文件格式，可以同时安装，指向同一个内容库即可共用项目。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5412bef4"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"desktop","label":"macOS App","sub":"DMG 安装","tone":"violet"},{"id":"package","label":"浏览器发行包","sub":"自带 Node","tone":"teal"},{"id":"source","label":"源码运行","sub":"浏览器版或桌面版","tone":"brand"}],"highlight":"desktop","rows":[{"group":"获取","label":"形式","values":{"desktop":"GitHub 最新发行版中的 DMG（Apple Silicon，macOS 13+）","package":"按系统与架构构建的压缩包 `ShowAI-browser-版本-系统-架构`","source":"克隆仓库后 `npm ci`"}},{"group":"获取","label":"平台","values":{"desktop":"macOS","package":"macOS · Linux · Windows","source":"macOS · Linux · Windows"}},{"group":"获取","label":"需要自己安装 Node.js","values":{"desktop":false,"package":false,"source":"22.12 或更高"}},{"group":"运行","label":"界面","values":{"desktop":"独立窗口","package":"浏览器标签页","source":"两种都可以"}},{"group":"运行","label":"关闭时等待保存完成","hint":"浏览器只能弹出离开确认，无法等异步保存结束","values":{"desktop":true,"package":"partial","source":"取决于所选界面"}},{"group":"运行","label":"终端需保持打开","values":{"desktop":false,"package":true,"source":true}},{"group":"Agent","label":"安装 Claude Code / Codex 插件","values":{"desktop":"「设置 → 插件」一键安装","package":"从源码仓库安装","source":"从源码仓库安装"}},{"group":"Agent","label":"附带 CLI","values":{"desktop":"App 自带运行时","package":"`./showai`（Windows 为 `showai.cmd`）","source":"`node dist-runtime/scripts/cli.mjs`"}},{"group":"Agent","label":"热更新开发","values":{"desktop":false,"package":false,"source":"`npm run dev:browser`"}}],"note":"所有方式默认使用 `~/.showai` 内容库，内容只保存在本机。浏览器发行包用 `npm run package:browser` 或 GitHub 的「Browser distributions」工作流构建。"},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-4b12b0c9"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-4a12af36"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"从源码运行"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"浏览器版支持 macOS、Linux 和 Windows，需要 Git、"},{"type":"text","text":"Node.js 22.12 或更高版本","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"和 npm。浏览器版和桌面版来自同一个仓库，构建命令不同。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-317df0da"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"获取源码并安装依赖","code":"git clone https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI.git\ncd ShowAI\nnpm ci"},{"title":"构建","variants":[{"label":"浏览器版","code":"npm run build:browser"},{"label":"桌面版","code":"npm run build"}],"note":"`npm run build` 会构建全部入口（前端、阅读器、CLI、插件和桌面主进程），耗时更长。"},{"title":"启动","variants":[{"label":"浏览器版","code":"npm run browser"},{"label":"桌面版","code":"npm run desktop"}],"note":"使用浏览器版期间保持终端运行。关闭浏览器标签页只会关掉界面，按 `Ctrl+C` 才会停止服务。","result":"浏览器版在终端打印「ShowAI 本地工作台」地址和内容库路径；桌面版打开应用窗口。"},{"title":"连接 Agent","body":"浏览器版不能在设置里一键安装插件。在仓库中为 Codex 或 Claude Code 安装插件，见 [在 Agent 中使用](doc:agent-hosts) 的「从源码安装」。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-327df26d"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"浏览器版的启动参数","open":false,"id":"node-2f7dedb4"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"npm run browser","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 等同于运行 "},{"type":"text","text":"node dist-runtime/scripts/cli.mjs serve","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，可以加参数："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8b189e23"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-8a189c90"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"node dist-runtime/scripts/cli.mjs serve --port 5175 --no-open --home /absolute/library"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--port PORT","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：固定端口；不指定时自动选择空闲端口。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5ca50e61"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-12d0e806"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--no-open","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：不自动打开浏览器，只打印地址。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b77ce336"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-13d0e999"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--home PATH","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：本次启动使用的内容库。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6569817"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-10d0e4e0"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：输出机器可读的启动信息。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-612e6cec"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-11d0e673"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8d18a149"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"参与开发：热更新工作台","open":false,"id":"node-307def47"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"npm run dev:browser","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 直接打开支持热更新的完整工作台，无需预先构建，默认地址 "},{"type":"text","text":"http://127.0.0.1:5173","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，内容库为仓库内的 "},{"type":"text","text":".showai-dev/library","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，不会碰到你的 "},{"type":"text","text":"~/.showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。桌面版用 "},{"type":"text","text":"npm run dev:open","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-68e7618"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-78e77ab"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"npm run dev:browser -- --port 5174 --home /absolute/library --no-open"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-2d7dea8e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"使用浏览器发行包"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"发行包里有独立的 Node、工作台网页、CLI、阅读器和组件编译器，不需要另装 Node 或 Electron。选择与你的系统和架构一致的包；各系统的包需要在对应平台上用 "},{"type":"text","text":"npm run package:browser","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 构建。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2e7dec21"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"解压到长期保存的位置","body":"发行包移动位置后，需要重新启动一次，刷新登记给 Agent 的执行路径。"},{"title":"启动工作台","variants":[{"label":"macOS","code":"./start.sh"},{"label":"Linux","code":"./start.sh"},{"label":"Windows","code":"start.cmd"}],"note":"macOS 也可以双击 `start.command`，Windows 双击 `start.cmd`。","result":"浏览器自动打开本机地址；没有打开时，复制终端打印的地址。"},{"title":"（可选）指定内容库","body":"用 `--home` 固定本次启动使用的目录。","variants":[{"label":"macOS / Linux","code":"./start.sh --home /absolute/path/to/library"},{"label":"Windows","code":"start.cmd --home C:\\Users\\you\\ShowAI"}]},{"title":"用完后停止","body":"在终端按 `Ctrl+C` 停止服务。关闭浏览器标签页只会关掉界面，服务仍在运行。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-2b7de768"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔒","tone":"rose","id":"node-2c7de8fb"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本地服务只监听 "},{"type":"text","text":"127.0.0.1","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，每次启动生成新的访问凭据，并检查请求的主机与来源。它不是多人服务器，不要把它开放到公网；团队协作请用 "},{"type":"text","text":"项目服务器","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5a413b64"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-297de442"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容保存在哪里"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"默认内容库是用户主目录下的 "},{"type":"text","text":".showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。下面是一个内容库的主要结构，点选查看每一项的作用。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2a7de5d5"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"initial":".showai/history/content.sqlite","caption":"内容库目录结构（只列出常见项）。","nodes":[{"name":".showai","kind":"dir","badge":"内容库","open":true,"summary":"默认位置 `~/.showai`。","detail":"可以在「设置 → 通用 → 内容库」中「选择内容库」，也可以用 `--home` 或环境变量 `SHOWAI_HOME` 固定一次启动的位置。","children":[{"name":"library.json","kind":"file","summary":"内容库的格式标记。","example":"{\n  \"format\": \"showai-library\",\n  \"version\": 2,\n  \"storage\": \"sqlite\"\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"history","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"正式内容所在。","children":[{"name":"content.sqlite","kind":"file","badge":"权威","summary":"事务型 SQLite 数据库，保存全部项目的当前内容。","detail":"每次保存原子地更新内容和并发令牌，再生成 `workspace` 下的可读文件。目录名沿用旧版内容库，以保持兼容。"}]},{"name":"workspace","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"可读的工作区文件，由数据库生成。","detail":"这些 JSON 便于查看和检索。请通过工作台、CLI 或 Agent 修改内容；直接改动的文件会被识别为外部修改，需要处理后才能继续保存。","children":[{"name":"projects","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"每个项目一个子目录。","children":[{"name":"<项目 ID>","kind":"dir","open":true,"summary":"一个项目。","children":[{"name":"project.json","kind":"file","summary":"项目元数据，包括文件夹层级和置顶。"},{"name":"pages","kind":"dir","summary":"项目里的页面和白板。","children":[{"name":"<页面 ID>.json","kind":"file","summary":"一个页面或白板的内容。","detail":"格式见 [页面文件格式](https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format)。"}]},{"name":"packages","kind":"dir","summary":"项目内的组件和模板版本。"}]}]},{"name":"packages","kind":"dir","summary":"注册到全局、所有项目可用的组件和模板。"},{"name":"assets","kind":"dir","summary":"页面内嵌的图片等资源，按内容摘要存放。"}]},{"name":"local","kind":"dir","summary":"本机状态：编辑草稿、缓存、锁和操作回执。","detail":"只属于这台设备。冲突时保留的本机草稿也在这里。"},{"name":"agent-runtime.json","kind":"file","badge":"Agent","summary":"登记的 ShowAI 运行时，插件靠它找到可执行程序。","detail":"启动工作台或运行 `runtime register` 时写入。移动了发行包或重新构建后，再启动一次即可刷新。"}]}]},"integrity":"sha256-74d9519ab11b450f4d2feec3813ad0e0d8a26b3d1c93510a74c9a765e1578215"},"id":"node-ab7adf51"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"几个入口看到同一批项目的前提","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：它们指向同一个内容库。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1d24fac6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eb1e4609"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"浏览器版的内容库选择","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"保存在 "},{"type":"text","text":"~/.showai-browser/settings.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，与桌面 App 的设置相互独立；桌面 App 的窗口配置在系统的应用数据目录。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-41ae8bb1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ea1e4476"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用 ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"--home","marks":[{"type":"code"},{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 或 ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_HOME","marks":[{"type":"code"},{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 启动时","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，本次启动固定使用该目录，设置里不能切换内容库；要换位置，下次启动时改参数。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c6d6847c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e91e42e3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-aa7addbe"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-a97adc2b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"浏览器版和桌面版的差别"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"功能相同，但浏览器有自己的限制："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a87ada98"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"文件选择","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：导入页面、导入组件源码、导出和切换内容库都使用工作台内的文件选择器，可输入路径、新建文件夹；导出文件已存在时会提示覆盖。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6d24cf5"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9242be72"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"关闭前的保存","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：页面仍然自动保存，也支持 "},{"type":"text","text":"Cmd/Ctrl+S","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。尚未保存或有冲突时，离开标签页会弹出浏览器的离开确认，但浏览器不能等保存完成再关闭，离开前请看一眼保存状态。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-248ee6a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9342c005"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"多个窗口","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：独立页面窗口在浏览器里是新标签页；「显示页面文件」会打开系统的文件管理器。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-317222cb"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9042bb4c"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同时开着桌面 App","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：两者选同一个内容目录就能读同一份项目，浏览器会收到 CLI 和 App 的文件变化通知；用旧版本内容写入会触发冲突处理。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8c49f7a0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9142bcdf"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-af7ae59d"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ae7ae40a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"更新"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"App：换成新版本","body":"从[最新发行版](https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest)下载新的 DMG，把 ShowAI 拖进「应用程序」替换旧版本。然后在「设置 → 插件」中点「更新并启用」，让插件换成新版 App 附带的版本，再重启 Agent。内容库不在 App 里，不受影响。"},{"title":"源码：拉取并重新构建","body":"拉取后重新安装依赖并构建，再重新启动工作台。","variants":[{"label":"浏览器版","code":"git pull\nnpm ci\nnpm run build:browser\nnpm run browser"},{"label":"桌面版","code":"git pull\nnpm ci\nnpm run build\nnpm run desktop"}]},{"title":"发行包：换成新版本的包","body":"解压新版本，用它的启动器启动一次，Agent 的运行时登记会随之更新。内容库不在发行包里，不受影响。"},{"title":"源码安装的 Codex 插件：刷新","code":"npm run plugin:update","note":"更新后新开一个 Codex 会话，旧会话不会重新加载工具。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-ad7ae277"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🗂️","tone":"blue","id":"node-ac7ae0e4"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"打开旧格式的内容库时，「设置 → 通用」会出现「升级内容库」：它导入现有内容并启用当前的存储方式，原始文件会保留。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-411d0a73"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-a37ad2b9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🚀","title":"快速上手","body":"连接 Agent，做出第一个界面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"},{"icon":"🔍","title":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","body":"插件未启用、Agent 找不到 ShowAI 时怎么办。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"},{"icon":"🗂️","title":"内容库与版本","body":"草稿、冲突、备份和维护。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-a27ad126"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-5312bd61","node-5212bbce","node-5112ba3b","node-5012b8a8","node-5712c3ad","node-5612c21a","node-5512c087","node-5412bef4","node-4b12b0c9","node-4a12af36","node-317df0da","node-327df26d","node-2f7dedb4","node-307def47","node-2d7dea8e","node-2e7dec21","node-2b7de768","node-2c7de8fb","node-297de442","node-2a7de5d5","node-ab7adf51","node-aa7addbe","node-a97adc2b","node-a87ada98","node-af7ae59d","node-ae7ae40a","node-ad7ae277","node-ac7ae0e4","node-a37ad2b9","node-a27ad126"]}},"comments":[]}